# A blank 40 MB disk (820 cylinders, 6 heads, 17 sectors): a Primary DOS
# Partition of 32 MB, which FDISK keeps within 65,535 sectors, the most DOS
# 3.3 can use, and an Extended DOS Partition of half the disk, given as a
# percentage, which is more than is left and is refused, then of 20%,
# with a logical drive of all of it.
disk 42823680 820/6/17
expect table
expect sectors
wait A:\\>
type FDISK
key ret
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait make the partition active
key n ret
wait Enter partition size
type 32
key ret
screen primary-32m
key esc
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait Enter choice
key 2 ret
wait Enter partition size
type 50%
screen extended-percent
key ret
wait exceeds the maximum
screen extended-too-big
key esc
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait Enter choice
key 2 ret
wait Enter partition size
type 20%
key ret
wait Extended DOS Partition created
screen extended-created
key esc
wait Enter logical drive size
key ret
screen logical-created
key esc
wait Enter choice
key esc
wait Press any key
key spc
wait A:\\>
quit
